  "id": "specific-factor",
  "term": "specific factor",
  "definition": "A specific factor is a particular part of an intervention that is treated as the element directly responsible for its effects. In this context, it is contrasted with non-specific or contextual influences such as general therapeutic aspects, social interaction, or novelty.",
